{"id":"ide0NUuTHO","name":"Solana","domain":"solana.com","claimed":false,"description":"An exceptionally fast, secure, and scalable blockchain network.","longDescription":"Solana is a fast, decentralized, and scalable brand that offers web3 infrastructure for everyone. With the ability to power thousands of transactions per second, Solana is dedicated to bringing the power of blockchain to developers and users alike. Whether you're a power user or a new consumer, Solana provides support and experiences tailored to all levels. By joining a community of millions, you can take advantage of the powerful tools and integrations offered by Solana. One of the key features of Solana is its speed. With block times of only 400 milliseconds, your users won't have to wait around. Additionally, Solana's decentralized network ensures the security and censorship resistance of your data. Scalability is another strength of Solana, as it can handle large quantities of transactions with fees remaining less than $0.01 for both developers and users. Solana also prides itself on being energy efficient, with its proof of stake network and innovative solutions reducing its environmental impact. Each Solana transaction uses about the same energy as a few Google searches. With Solana, you can build, learn, and network while contributing to a more inclusive and sustainable blockchain future.","links":[{"name":"youtube","url":"https://youtube.com/youtube.com/solanalabs"},{"name":"github","url":"https://github.com/solana-labs"},{"name":"twitter","url":"https://twitter.com/solana"},{"name":"linkedin","url":"https://linkedin.com/company/solana-foundation"}],"logos":[{"theme":"light","formats":[{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/ide0NUuTHO/theme/light/logo.svg?c=1bxixsvzzu3wge90jphd3o3qf2w8oWMg6tL","background":"transparent","format":"svg","height":409,"width":2190,"size":9073},{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/ide0NUuTHO/w/800/h/149/theme/light/logo.png?c=1bxixsvzzu3wge90jphd3o3qf2w8oWMg6tL","backg